  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4304.05 Title V Operating Permit Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4304.05 Title V Operating Permit Required. The owner or operator of an existing OSWI unit subject to this chapter shall apply for and obtain a title V operating permit, in accordance with Env-A 609 and 40 CFR §60.3059.\n\nSource. #14248, eff 5-20-25, EXPIRES: 5-20-35",
